+config ROCKCHIP_SUSPEND_MODE
+	bool "Rockchip suspend mode config"
+	depends on OF && SUSPEND
+	help
+	  Say y here to tell the ATF/BL31 firmware which low-power mode and
+	  wakeup sources to use when entering suspend-to-RAM, via the
+	  rockchip,sleep-mode-config and rockchip,wakeup-config properties on
+	  a "rockchip-suspend" devicetree node. Without this, boards that rely
+	  on it enter suspend correctly but never wake from it, since nothing
+	  tells firmware which wakeup sources to arm before powering down.
+
 endif

